{
  "_doc": [
    "Metalstorm named-effect library (PLAN-fx-offload.md §5 'effect library'; ",
    "the X3 'name -> emitter configs -> GPU buffers' source of truth). Every ",
    "authored effect is referenced BY NAME ONLY from effects/weapon-fx.json and ",
    "from unit bindings.json (effects/bindings.example.json) — nothing authored ",
    "ever touches a particle. The JS FX system compiles each emitter into ",
    "per-instance attribute rows for the matching shader in shaders/fx/ and owns ",
    "the lifecycle (spawn / retire / budget cull).",
    "",
    "These are the metalstorm KINETIC analogues of the BAR/ZK authored CEGs ",
    "(PLAN-metalstorm.md §6: explosive/projectile weapons dominate, lasers rare). ",
    "STUB TUNING: shapes are plausible, numbers are placeholders — tune against ",
    "the render harness (PLAN-model-harness.md), not balance.",
    "",
    "Emitter kinds map 1:1 to shaders/fx/ programs:",
    "  particle    -> particle.vert/frag.glsl      (billboard|ground|stretch)",
    "  muzzleFlash -> muzzle-flash.vert/frag.glsl",
    "  tracer      -> tracer.vert/frag.glsl        (projectile-attached)",
    "  trail       -> trail.vert/frag.glsl         (projectile-attached)",
    "  shockwave   -> shockwave.vert/frag.glsl     (screen-space warp)",
    "Colours are linear HDR RGBA; values >1 are intended to bloom. See ",
    "effects/README.md for the full field schema and units."
  ],
  "version": 1,

  "atlas": {
    "texture": "unittextures/fx_atlas.ktx2",
    "cols": 8,
    "rows": 8,
    "_doc": "One sprite cell = (1/cols, 1/rows). Frame indices below are cell ids (row-major). Authored .ktx2 (UASTC+Zstd) per PLAN-metalstorm.md §9; registered in gamedata/resources.lua groundfx.",
    "frames": {
      "dot":      0,
      "spark":    1,
      "fireball": 2,
      "smoke":    3,
      "dust":     4,
      "flash":    5,
      "ring":     6,
      "foam":     7,
      "smoketrail": 16,
      "bubbletrail": 17,
      "scorch":   24
    }
  },

